    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For over 14 years, Karungi Mary taught with heart in Uganda, moving from classroom teacher to educator and mentor. She always knew that learning was the key to a better life, not just for her students, but for herself. Yet, even with her many degrees, including a Bachelor's and multiple Diplomas, she felt there was a bigger purpose calling her. She wanted to influence entire education systems, not just a single class.",
